INFO:__main__:- name: Reality Checking Agent Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is designed for reality checks. Its task is to Allow or Deny any action taken by the AIAH, given the environment and health status parameters.
INFO:__main__:- requires: Status from ES,AIAH action, Health Parameters
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:{    "possibility": "possible",    "reasoning": "Despite extremely challenging survival conditions, the human has a minimal chance of executing an emergency survival migration. With extremely low energy (2), critical thirst (9), high hunger (7), and significant health risks, the action is feasible but extremely dangerous. Body temperature (38.2°C) indicates heat stress, and the environment presents an existential threat with 42°C temperatures and complete ecosystem collapse. The 'possible' classification is based on the human's last-resort survival instinct and remaining physiological capacity, but survival probability is extremely low. Immediate professional intervention or rescue would be required to prevent imminent death."}
